IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-PUNICA-LORA.

DATA DIVISION.
01 BATCH-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NUM-ADAPTERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 DISTINCT-ADAPTERS   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X10         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PUNICA.
    IF BATCH-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-ADAPTERS TO DISTINCT-ADAPTERS.
    MOVE 36 TO SPEEDUP-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 DISTINCT-ADAPTERS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
